        <mxCell id="invariants" value="&lt;b&gt;Invariants (all tested)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. publish_unknown blocks further posting for its account; nothing retries a post once Post was clicked.&lt;br&gt;2. At most one video is in publishing (checked and claimed in one SQLite transaction).&lt;br&gt;3. processing and publishing carry a lease token; a result with the wrong token is rejected.&lt;br&gt;4. baseline never becomes a candidate: the first scan of a stream only records markers.&lt;br&gt;5. A scan older than the last one is rejected; a batch with one bad item is rejected whole.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source: docs/FLOWS.md section 2.&lt;/i&gt;" style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#b0a000;" vertex="1" parent="1">
